## Authentication

### Public API Header
```
apikeypublic: {PUBLIC_KEY}
apiclientpublic: {PUBLIC_CLIENT}
```

### Private API Header
```
apikeyprivate: {PRIVATE_KEY}
apiclientprivate: {PRIVATE_CLIENT}
```

